From 86aa0e5158614e1294e5ddc40f1ba632a71f5302 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:49:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: Calculator in the PlaitOS look

- Colors from the wallpaper (Material You palettes) with a dark twin in
  values-night; dark follows the system (dark is the PlaitOS default)
- Display on the surface tone, numbers on a tonal surface one step away,
  operators on secondary container, the function pad on primary container
  (the one accent), Material 3 error color, matching status and navigation
  bars; layout unchanged
- versionCode 38, so it installs as an update of the ROM's copy

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017VXjYUWzBqMCeUoJD2Suc4
